cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "csyncmer_fast: an efficient single-threaded C implementation of closed syncmer extraction"
abstract: >-
  A header-only C library for fast extraction of closed syncmers, using AVX2 SIMD
  with a two-stack sliding-window minimum and a rolling ntHash. Provides
  canonical and non-canonical variants, count-only and position-collecting
  entry points, a scalar fallback, and an exact 64-bit streaming iterator.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/frankandreace/csyncmer_fast"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
keywords:
